Notes:
  gen_lp_*        — per-token log-prob of generated text under teacher (higher = better)
  gen_lp_p_value  — two-sided p-value for H0: tokens ~ teacher (uniform on [0,1] if correct)
  correct_per_call — PTP tokens accepted per speculative step (higher = better speculation)
  ms_per_token — wall-clock speed (lower = faster)
  compression_ratio — gzip size / raw size; lower = more repetitive/degenerate
  referee_lp_*       — per-token log-prob under referee model (independent quality measure)
  referee_judge_score — 1–5 quality rating from referee model (higher = better)
